{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating car crash with your family, you awaken in a surreal version of purgatory. With no memory and only a cryptic gatekeeper guiding your way, you begin to explore this haunting realm. Along your path, you'll meet lost souls, uncover hidden truths, and confront twisted reflections of your trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not everything is what it seems. What if the world you've come to trust is built on lies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost Identity</strong> is a story-rich 2D platformer focused on atmosphere, mystery, and psychological exploration \u2014 all without any combat. Survive deadly traps, collect fragments of your past, and choose your final fate: return or let go.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654650?t=1745787927","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3654650?t=1745787927","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654650/d2998bedfd06f4f1c461ca0200f12befac0e2914/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745787927","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654650/d2998bedfd06f4f1c461ca0200f12befac0e2914/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745787927","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating car crash with your family, you awaken in a surreal version of purgatory. With no memory and only a cryptic gatekeeper guiding your way, you begin to explore this haunting realm. Along your path, you'll meet lost souls, uncover hidden truths, and confront twisted reflections of your trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But not everything is what it seems. What if the world you've come to trust is built on lies?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Lost Iden